# The build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT for every image here, because
# GoReleaser stages files into its context keeping their paths and a
# Dockerfile can only be written for one context.
#
# So the context has to be narrowed here rather than per component: deny
# everything, then admit exactly the three build outputs the Dockerfiles
# copy. A pattern that stops matching does not fail loudly — it sends more
# of the repository to the builder, or copies nothing and fails with a
# checksum error naming a path that is plainly on disk.
*

!log/build/site-packages-*
!stat/build/libs/stat.jar
!web/dist
!e2e/build
